{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the bloodiest barbershop in town.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assume the skin of a cat vampire trying to maintain a barbershop\u2026 and his bloodlust under control. Wash and cut hairs and beards, avoid biting your clients and clean the traces of your crimes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaotic minigames</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haircuts have never been so hard. And you thought that pretty doesn't hurt...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your reputation (and your bloodlust)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Biting people can be tempting, but leaves traces behind. Each attack or mistake affects your reputation with the village. And yes, it changes the course of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Characteristics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increasing bloodlust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1746710?t=1752102602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/49bd99afadca2615fae06bf3a6938cea4e98f2ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752102602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/999b86bf69f66f3b07099d80500f15bb480b4fae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752102602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746710/999b86bf69f66f3b07099d80500f15bb480b4fae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752102602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"note